+---
+id: task-001-fix-sku-shipping-and-vat-reports
+type: task
+title: "Fix SKU, shipping, and VAT reports"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Corrected SKU lookup to canonicalize case and surrounding spaces, made €50.00 goods eligible for
+free shipping, and calculated each VAT line with half-up rounding. Added regression coverage for
+lower-case SKU lookup, the exact free-shipping threshold, and €1.99 standard-rate VAT. `npm test`
+passes (16 tests).
